**1. 写出下面程序的运行结果。**

```java
public class Test1 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
            for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++) {
                System.out.print(j + " ");
            }
            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
```

**2. 写出下面程序的运行结果。**

```java
public class Test2 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] arr = {3, 8, 1, 6, 9};
        int max = arr[0];
        int min = arr[0];
        for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
            if (arr[i] > max) {
                max = arr[i];
            }
            if (arr[i] < min) {
                min = arr[i];
            }
        }
        System.out.println("max=" + max + ",min=" + min);
        System.out.println("sum=" + (max + min));
    }
}
```

**3. 写出下面程序的运行结果。**

```java
public class Test3 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(change(5));
        System.out.println(change(1));
    }

    public static int change(int n) {
        if (n <= 1) {
            return 1;
        }
        return n * change(n - 1);
    }
}
```

**4. 写出下面程序的运行结果。**

```java
class Person {
    String name;

    public Person(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }

    public String getName() {
        return name;
    }
}

public class Test4 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Person p1 = new Person("张三");
        Person p2 = new Person("李四");
        System.out.println(p1.getName());
        change(p1, p2);
        System.out.println(p1.getName());
    }

    public static void change(Person a, Person b) {
        a = b;
        b.name = "王五";
    }
}
```

